"&kword; provides other commonly used variables that you might find useful. "
"This set of variables are specific to the document. You can insert these "
"variables by selecting <menuchoice> <guimenu>Insert</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Variable</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Document Information</"
"guimenuitem> </menuchoice> from the menubar. This will bring up a list of "
"variables. The variables are detailed below."
msgstr ""

